hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"292","Al-Hasan bin Abdullah bin Mansour Al-Antaki narrated to us, Muhammad bin Kathir narrated to us, on the authority of Al-Awza’i, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ajlan, on the authority of Sa’id Al-Maqbari, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, said: The Messenger of God, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, said: “If one of you steps on something that is harmful to him or “His shoes, and the dust will purify them.” Abu Bakr said: Abu Nasr reported on the authority of Abu Sa’id regarding the story of the sandals from this chapter. I mentioned it in the Book of Prayer."
